{"id": "33908", "revid": "2441334", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=33908", "title": "Springville", "text": "Springville is a city in the Wasatch Range in Utah.\nGet in.\nSpringville is accessible by car and by UTA bus from Salt Lake City.\nGet around.\nPublic transportation in Springville is limited. A car is highly recommended."}
